title: One types at the very start of a file and the other at the end of its last line, then on adjacent lines, at the same time
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^Ht1\.Ht2\.Ht3\.Ht4\.Ht5\.Ht6\.line 01\n
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: \nline 11\nline 12Ge1\.Ge2\.Ge3\.Ge4\.Ge5\.Ge6\.\n$
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: \nline 05\nline 06Hm1\.Hm2\.Hm3\.Hm4\.Hm5\.Hm6\.Hm7\.Hm8\.\nGm1\.Gm2\.Gm3\.Gm4\.Gm5\.Gm6\.Gm7\.Gm8\.line 07\nline 08\n

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9000
edit notes.txt 1 1
wait 1200
type Ht1.
wait 150
type Ht2.
wait 150
type Ht3.
wait 150
type Ht4.
wait 150
type Ht5.
wait 150
type Ht6.
wait 150
wait 800
edit notes.txt 6 1
key end
wait 600
type Hm1.
wait 150
type Hm2.
wait 150
type Hm3.
wait 150
type Hm4.
wait 150
type Hm5.
wait 150
type Hm6.
wait 150
type Hm7.
wait 150
type Hm8.
wait 150
wait 2500
mark host-after
wait 9000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
edit notes.txt 12 1
key end
wait 1700
type Ge1.
wait 150
type Ge2.
wait 150
type Ge3.
wait 150
type Ge4.
wait 150
type Ge5.
wait 150
type Ge6.
wait 150
wait 800
edit notes.txt 7 1
wait 700
type Gm1.
wait 150
type Gm2.
wait 150
type Gm3.
wait 150
type Gm4.
wait 150
type Gm5.
wait 150
type Gm6.
wait 150
type Gm7.
wait 150
type Gm8.
wait 150
wait 2500
mark after
wait 2500
key save
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
